{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal model integrating RNA (pca_n2000) and image (resnet50) data via concatenation fusion for singleprofile tasks. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest moderate performance, establishing a baseline for multimodal approaches. Uncertainty remains about the relative contribution of modality integration versus individual encoder choices, as no single-modality comparisons were made."
}

